  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energuate UCL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main project outcomes are the improvements in access and quality of electricity supply, particularly to serve the rural population. Beyond the project, the main expected market effect is to improve financial integration which derives from introducing a replicable instrument (e.g., sustainability linked loan) to the market, thus diversifying and increasing sources of financing for players in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment entails a senior unsecured Sustainability-Linked Loan to Distribuidora de Electricidad del Oriente S.A. (DEORSA) and Distribuidora de Electricidad del Occidente S.A. (DEOCSA, together with DEORSA Energuate or the Company).</narrative>
  </description>
